  "content": "Puretvā pāramī sabbe, sabbe pacceka nāyakā.Sīvali guṇa tejena, parittaṃ taṃ bhaṇāmahe.Natāsise ca mosīse, nānājālīti sajjalī.Sadeva manussa pūjitaṃ, sabba lābhā bhavantu te.Sīvali ca mahāthero, so raho paccayādinaṃ.Piyo devamanussānaṃ, piyo brāhmaṇamuttamaṃ.Piyo nāga supaṇṇānaṃ, pīnindriyaṃ namāmahaṃ.Padumuttaro nāma jino, sabba dhammesu cakkhumā.Ito sata sahassamhi, kappe uppajji nāyako.Sattāhaṃ dvāra mūḷho haṃ, mahādukkha samappito.Mātā me chanda dānena, evamāsi sudukkhitā.Kesesu chijjamānesu, arahattamapāpuṇiṃ.Devā nāgā manussā ca, paccayānup anenti te.Padumuttara nāmañca, Vipassissa vināyakaṃ.Sampūjayaṃ pamudito, paccayehi visesato.Tato tesaṃ visesena, kammānaṃ vipuluttamaṃ.Lābhaṃ labhāmi sabbattha, vane gāme jale thale.Tadā devā paṇītehi, mamatthāya mahāmati.Paccayehi mahāvīro, sasaṅgho loka nāyako.Upadiṭṭhā mayā buddho, gantvā Revatamassa.Tato Jetavanaṃ gantvā, etadaggaṭṭhapesi maṃ.Revataṃ dassanatthāya, yadāyāti vināyako.Tiṃsa bhikkhu sahassehi, saha lokaṃ nāyako.Lābhinaṃ Sīvali aggo, mama sissesu bhikkhavo.Sabbaloka hito satthā, kittayī parisāsu maṃ.Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ, bhavā sabbe samūhatā.Nāgova bandhanaṃ chetvā, viharāmi anāsavo.Svāgataṃ vata me āsi, buddhaseṭṭhassa santike.Tisso vijjā anuppattā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsane.Paṭisambhidā catasso ca, vimokkhāpi ca aṭṭhame.Chaḷabhiññā sacchikatā, kataṃ buddhassa sāsane.Buddhaputto mahāthero, Sīvali jinasāvako.Uggatejo mahāvīro, tejasā jinasāsane.Rakkhanto sīla tejena, dhanavanto yasassino.Evaṃ tejānubhāvena, sadā rakkhatu Sīvali.Kappaṭāyitī buddhassa, bodhimūle nisīdiya.Mārasenappamaddanto, sadā rakkhatu Sīvali.Dasa pāramitāpatto, pabbaji jinasāsane.Gotama sakyaputtosi, therena mama Sīvali.Mahāsāvakā asītisu, Puṇṇathero yasassiso.Bhavabhoga aggalābhīsu, uttamo tena Sīvali.Evaṃ acintiyā Buddhā, Buddhadhammā acintiyā.Acintiyesu pasannānaṃ, vipāko hoti acintiyo.Tesaṃ saccena sīlena, khanti metta balena ca.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, sabba dukkha vināsanaṃ.Tesaṃ saccena sīlena, khanti metta balena ca.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, sabba bhaya vināsanaṃ.Tesaṃ saccena sīlena, khanti metta balena ca.Tepi maṃ anurakkhantu, sabba roga vināsanaṃ.",
